<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Certificat de Réussite - ESPRIT</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f5f5 0%, #e0e0e0 100%);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .certificate-container {
            background: white;
            border: 12px solid #c41e3a;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-width: 1200px;
            width: 100%;
            position: relative;
        }

        .certificate-inner {
            border: 3px solid #c41e3a;
            margin: 10px;
            padding: 25px 40px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 30px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .left-section {
            text-align: center;
            border-right: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
            padding-right: 30px;
        }

        .right-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding-left: 30px;
        }

        .school-name {
            color: #c41e3a;
            font-size: 13px;
            letter-spacing: 5px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .title {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .certificate-title {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .intro-text {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .recipient-name {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 26px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 15px 0;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 50px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #c41e3a;
            margin: 18px auto;
        }

        .achievement {
            margin: 18px 0;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #fafafa;
        }

        .achievement-text {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .course-name {
            color: #c41e3a;
            font-size: 17px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .score {
            color: #333;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .score-value {
            color: #c41e3a;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        .competences {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 11px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            margin: 12px 0;
        }

        .footer {
            margin-top: 18px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .date-info {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .date-value {
            color: #333;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .certificate-number {
            color: #999;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                margin: 0;
                padding: 0;
            }
            .certificate-container {
                box-shadow: none;
                max-width: 100%;
                border: 8px solid #c41e3a;
                page-break-inside: avoid;
                height: 100vh;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
            }
            .certificate-inner {
                margin: 8px;
                padding: 20px 35px;
                gap: 25px;
                width: 100%;
            }
            .left-section {
                padding-right: 25px;
            }
            .right-section {
                padding-left: 25px;
            }
            @page {
                size: A4 landscape;
                margin: 0;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 1024px) {
            .certificate-inner {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
            }
            .left-section {
                border-right: none;
                border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
                padding-right: 0;
                padding-bottom: 20px;
            }
            .right-section {
                padding-left: 0;
                padding-top: 20px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .certificate-inner {
                padding: 30px 20px;
            }
            .title {
                font-size: 18px;
            }
            .certificate-title {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
            .recipient-name {
                font-size: 24px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="certificate-container">
        <div class="certificate-inner">
            <div class="left-section">
                <div class="school-name">ESPRIT</div>
                <div class="title">
                    ÉCOLE SUPÉRIEURE PRIVÉE D'INGÉNIERIE<br>
                    ET DE TECHNOLOGIE
                </div>
                <div class="subtitle">Établissement d'Enseignement Supérieur Privé agréé par l'État</div>
                
                <div class="certificate-title">CERTIFICAT DE RÉUSSITE</div>
                
                <div class="intro-text">Le présent certificat atteste que</div>
                
                <div class="recipient-name">{{ user.name }} {{ user.lastname|upper }}</div>
                
                <div class="divider"></div>
            </div>

            <div class="right-section">
                <div class="achievement">
                    <div class="achievement-text">
                        a suivi avec assiduité et réussi avec succès<br>
                        l'ensemble des évaluations du cours
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="course-name">« Cours Symfony »</div>
                    
                    <div class="score">
                        avec une note finale de <span class="score-value">100.00%</span>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="competences">
                        démontrant ainsi une maîtrise excellente des compétences<br>
                        et connaissances requises dans cette discipline.
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="footer">
                    <div class="date-info">
                        Délivré le <span class="date-value">03/12/2025</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="certificate-number">Certificat n°346886</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>